WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.580
Katsura, heading out!

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.140
This is a one night ceremony!

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:16.450
Tatsuma, show them that you 
haven't lost your edge!

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.530
Yeah, got it!

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.320
Time to go wild!

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.960
This is a rain from the heavens!

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.710
Th-The clouds...

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:28.710
The clouds that were covering 
Earth have dissipated.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:32.800
<b>You fooled me.</b>

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.680
I fooled no one.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:37.930
The words written on that 
planet aren't the words

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.260
of a spy, a general, or a Renho.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:45.600
They're Elizabeth's first 
and last words of truth!

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.230
Elizabeth!

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:28.910
<b>Dark Vader's nefarious plot has been 
halted by his fellow Renho, Elizabeth!!</b>

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.960
<b>A one-man rebellion has been started by someone who 
betrayed his home planet for the sake of his loved ones!!</b>

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:39.930
<b>Empty Planet</b>

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:43.540
Someone else...

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.250
Someone else is starting a rebellion!

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.430
Who is it?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:49.310
One of the spies who infiltrated Earth

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:53.100
tampered with the seeds to make this happen.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.440
Only one person was in a 
position to make that happen.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.070
<b>What... General Eren...?</b>

00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:00.200
There was also that explosion.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.200
<b>Is a rebel?!</b>

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:03.450
<b>Launch in the Gunsams and 
shoot down the traitor!!</b>

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:03.450
It wasn't my bomb that blew up.

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:08.580
As the leader of the Gunsam 
force for invading Earth,

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:12.290
he was able to secretly sabotage them.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.290
<b>Hey! Look!</b>

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:18.460
<b>My fellow Earth lovers. This is my final order as a 
general. Escape immediately. Don't throw your lives away.</b>

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:20.300
<b>What... General Eren...?</b>

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.890
<b>Th-The Gunsams!</b>

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.890
This was his plan from the beginning.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:29.150
He lied to you and betrayed you,

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:33.360
so he could return to the Renho 
and stop the invasion of Earth.

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.690
<b>Curse you, traitor!</b>

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:37.820
And he did in a way that 
would stop his own men,

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:37.820
<b>Launch in the remaining ships!</b>

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:41.200
who also loved Earth, from rebelling,

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:47.700
in order to take on the root 
of all evil, Dark Vader.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.570
He chose to betray both of his homes

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.730
to protect his Earth and Renho friends.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.760
<b>I see.</b>

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.310
<b>You rose to the rank of general 
so you could stop my plan.</b>

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:12.270
<b>You were locked onto my head 
with the eyes of a tiger.</b>

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:17.770
Eren, you thought you could 
take my head so easily?

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:23.280
You thought it would be so 
easy to change the world?

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:26.950
Nothing has changed.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.870
Earth's fate will be the same,

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:32.200
as will the fate of the Renho.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:38.420
You may have left your qualms back on Earth,

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.170
but are you prepared to give 
your life to take mine?

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.840
You've only taken out my main camera!

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:48.790
Don't make me laugh!

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:52.270
Eren, you are the only one who will die here.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:55.560
You have deceived and 
betrayed your loved ones for

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.300
the sake of your loved ones.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:00.900
You turned your back on Earth and the Renho.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.530
You are alone in this giant universe.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:09.030
You have no allies.

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:13.540
No one is watching you. Nothing will change.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:16.040
You will simply die alone.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:28.970
Eren!

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:30.430
Curse you...

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.940
Vader, you're absolutely right.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:47.290
I've been lying to myself 
and betraying my friends.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:53.420
I no longer know who I am.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.340
But that is fine.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:59.000
I may no longer have a planet to call home,

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.000
I may no longer have an identity,

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.500
but if I can die as Katsura-san's friend,

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:07.010
that's good enough.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:11.580
Then die!

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.600
Die with no friends in 
the dark void of space!

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:19.480
He has a friend right here!

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:22.080
It doesn't matter if you're in a dark place

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:24.290
or at the farthest reaches of the universe!

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:30.820
I told you that I've got your back!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.320
<b>Ka...</b>

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.330
-tsura-san...

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.330
It's not Tsura, it's Katsura.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.830
Wait, how are you reading my mind?

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.080
Are you a Newtype?

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:42.900
Why?

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.590
I told you not to look!

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:47.970
You weren't supposed to remember!

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.450
Why am I...

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:54.100
...crying?

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:58.020
It must be like when a parent starts crying

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:03.610
when he sees his child fall 
down because it must hurt.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:07.610
This is a really stupid Newtype conversation!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:10.610
Oh, I can see time!

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.620
Uh, could you stop ruining this moment?!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.660
Elizabeth!

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.040
Katsura-san!

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:26.420
The rat took the bait.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:30.010
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.860
He repaired himself?!

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:34.010
I-Is he a cyborg?!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.510
Fire!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:39.520
Reduce them all to space dust!

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:41.280
Oh, no! The fleet is in position!

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.310
Hurry!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.710
There's no hope!

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:44.810
It's too late!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.860
Elizabeth!

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:03.060
Y-You bastards...

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:04.790
What is...

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:08.630
...the meaning of this?

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.130
I-Impossible...

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:16.640
The enemy fleet fired on Dark Vader?

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:23.390
Dark Vader, you're the 
one who's alone in space!

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:26.180
Sorry to keep you waiting, Zura.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:27.900
We've formed the Renth Alliance!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.400
Sakamoto!

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.400
C-Curse you!

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.070
<b>Dark Vader, you said</b>

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.410
<b>that the Renho were nothing more 
than tools for conquering Earth.</b>

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.080
<b>But the people of Earth said</b>

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.410
<b>that they would be willing to give up a planet 
or two for the sake of their fellow Earthlings.</b>

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:42.870
<b>That friends</b>

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.420
<b>were a treasure that could never be replaced.</b>

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:48.920
<b>We could kill the Earthlings and 
make their planet our new home,</b>

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.920
<b>but is there any value in 
a planet with no friends?</b>

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:59.430
<b>Samurai, don't forget your promise.</b>

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:59.430
Yeah, we'll help you conquer 
any planet you choose.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.810
<b>In that case...</b>

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:01.730
In that case,

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.430
will you join

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:04.940
our comrade,

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:09.900
who has protected our second home,

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.360
Earth, the Renho pride, and his Renho comrades all alone!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:18.850
Will you help us join our friend 
in conquering that empty planet?

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.440
Consider it done.

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:23.620
Renth Alliance, clause one.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.880
When Earthlings and Renho 
play Uno, follow space rules.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.400
Clause two.

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:33.320
When Renho are visiting Earth, let them play

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:36.470
SNES games along with the NES games.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:39.390
In other words, we're buddies now.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:44.350
In other words, you used 
ActRaiser to string them along!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.890
What kind of alliance is this?!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.920
On Earth, you can eat all 
the ActRaiser you want!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:50.650
Yeah!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:52.360
What's wrong with this planet?!

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.900
They betrayed their leader for ActRaiser!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:59.410
Force and ideas won't make people change.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:03.320
It comes down to personal 
benefit and connections, huh?

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:06.160
His business deals are always stupid.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:12.170
Eren, we weren't able to take Earth,

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.170
but I guess

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:20.180
we've found something much more important.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:23.680
<b>Katsura-san...</b>

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:23.680
Don't say a word.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:27.650
You and I were just doing what was right.

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:31.160
We chose to do the honorable thing.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:33.650
There's no need for apologizes or farewells.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:36.690
The only words we need are...

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.200
<b>Thank you bunny.</b>

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.700
OC!

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:47.960
Let's go, Elizabeth!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.710
With our friends on Earth,

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.710
and all our friends in the universe!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.210
Fire!

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.550
C-Curse you all!

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:05.180
You intend to destroy your own planet 
for the sake of your friends?

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.370
How will your tribe survive

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:12.570
when you are trapped in the void 
with no place to call home?

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:17.260
You need this star... You need me!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.160
You can have this empty shell.

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.660
It'll be your coffin.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.570
Nobody will mourn you!

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:31.120
Nobody will remember you!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.580
You're going to die an empty death

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.920
on your empty planet!

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:38.360
You will be the ones who die, samurai!

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.400
Did we kill him?

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:28.510
The planet is falling apart...

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.020
<b>No, it isn't falling apart.</b>

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.020
What? What do you mean?

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:39.020
As I said...

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:42.490
You can defeat me, but nothing will change!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.400
What?!

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:46.550
Dark Vader was just like the rest of you.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:49.330
Nothing more than my puppet.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.830
And he wasn't the only one.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:56.500
Every leader on this planet

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:00.840
has been a hollow receptacle of my creation.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:04.700
Have you not realized yet?

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:07.470
You have made an enemy

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:10.810
of the planet itself!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:13.350
I-Impossible! The planet

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:16.350
transformed into a giant Renho!

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:19.360
V-Vader, could it be...

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:23.110
The Renho mothership's central system, Sagi.

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:25.250
That is the true identity of Vader...

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:30.620
No, the true identity of every 
false ruler over the Renho!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.370
Huh?

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:36.110
Long ago, the planet of the Renho 
was destroyed in a great war,

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:39.100
and ever since, we have 
lived on this metal planet.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.980
That was when we created Sagi.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.630
The brain of the planet, which 
controlled the environment

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:50.140
and developed a road map for our survival.

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:56.640
But Sagi went berserk and 
began to create leaders

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:03.650
as tools for implementing the 
most effective survival strategy.

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:09.740
Eventually, this became tradition.

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.570
The people were forced to 
become silent soldiers.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:17.290
Yes, we Renho were created by Sagi.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:22.670
He considered us to be nothing 
more than empty tools.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:26.170
Tools that could easily be 
replaced, just like this machine.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:30.610
He believes that he can ensure 
the survival of our tribe

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:33.170
by taking over a rich planet.

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.930
But now that his tools 
have turned against him,

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:40.940
Sagi must resort to using another tool.

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:43.900
The ultimate tool, the planet itself!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:51.160
I no longer need you worthless defects!

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:55.160
I will simply conquer Earth myself!

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.510
The technology of the Gunsams has

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:01.170
been perfected in this ultimate weapon,

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.460
the White Lucifer!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:07.460
With this power, I can conquer 
Earth, no, the universe, by myself!

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:14.000
Once my loyal troops have 
eliminated you defects and

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:16.930
the universe falls into my hands,

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:20.640
the Renho will have eternal glory!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.940
I promised to conquer the planet,

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:28.610
but I didn't think we'd actually 
have to fight the planet.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:31.780
White Lucifer vs. White Wavy Hair.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.530
This should be a grand show!

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:37.360
Don't call me White Wavy Hair!

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:40.980
How are we supposed to 
fight that Renho monster?

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:44.850
Oh, I see a Dombo three times 
dumber than a normal Dombo.

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:45.960
Why don't you head out there?

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:50.270
Gintoki, Earth is finished at this rate.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:54.600
I'm gonna skip the fight 
and go visit Club Smile.

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:57.950
There isn't much point in leaving 
behind your worthless genes.

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:00.020
And there isn't enough time left.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.040
It'll be okay.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:03.060
If I thrust three times faster than normal...

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:06.070
Hey, stop whining like babies!

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:10.570
Men always lose their balls when 
their back is against the wall.

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:12.640
You telling me that I've lost my balls?!

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.580
You ever seen me use my balls?!

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:17.280
Want my balls in your face?!

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.420
What are you talking about?

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:22.470
Anyway, are you riding Kairinmaru?

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:25.000
I'm riding a blond babe!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:25.830
Don't make fun of me!

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:27.430
Good.

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:29.740
The members of the Kaientai were 
able to escape at the last second,

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:31.510
and we're back on the ship.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.160
We can join up.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.470
I have one final plan.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:39.100
This is the only way to 
protect Earth and the Renho!

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.980
What? Join up and make babies?

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.600
I'm not going to fuse with you!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:46.610
You almost had it.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:30.150
Huh? What is this?

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:33.650
Uh, the ship is transforming?!

00:17:35.770 --> 00:17:37.710
Huh? What is this?!

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:40.450
That ship's also transforming?!

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:49.760
Hey, Mutsu!

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:50.850
What is this?!

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.170
Nobody told me this would happen!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:28.950
You almost had it.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.920
We aren't fusing to make babies.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.210
We're fusing to make a robot.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.090
Th-That's...

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:39.090
Impossible...

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.590
That's...

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:45.470
What is that giant robot?!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.630
This is Earth's, the Renho's...

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:50.380
No,

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:53.070
the universe's final hope!

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:56.530
The Galactic Merchant Fleet Robot!

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.740
Kaien!

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:05.160
What is this Galactic Merchant Fleet?!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:07.580
Why are merchant ships 
fusing into a giant robot?!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:09.580
What kind of merchants are you?!

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:12.870
There's nothing standard about 
doing business in space.

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:15.460
Good thing I modified our fleet,

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.590
since I was expecting to have to deal 
with giant aliens at some point.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:22.370
Standard?! This has nothing 
to do with what's standard!

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.600
This is turning into a 
completely different show!

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:26.320
Mutsu!

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:30.440
What have you done to my 
poor little Kairinmaru?!

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.580
You're not supposed to do anything to the 
ship without the captain's permission!

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.290
It's shaking so hard that...

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:38.840
A captain would actually be on his ship

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:41.860
