00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:49.130
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:51.120
Best of luck, Captain!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:54.410
They're calling her Captain now!

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:56.130
Let's get going then!

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:56.900
Huh? Huh?

00:19:56.900 --> 00:19:58.410
Wh-What?!

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.050
Wh-Where are we?

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:05.550
Is everyone in their cockpits?

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:06.710
Listen carefully.

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:10.560
Kaien is so big that it's been 
divided into six sectors.

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:15.560
I need you to pilot these six sectors.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:19.320
Kagura and I will handle 
the right and left legs.

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:22.490
The two fuzzheads get 
the right and left arms.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:26.320
Hey! You girls know how to 
control a man's lower body?!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.180
